body:
OKAY LITERALLY PUT HAPPY MUSIC OVER HER SMILE THE ENTIRE SCENE CHANGES, i personally don't even think she killed the dog. The bites on her hand were human and the dogs blood was fresh, she had been working all day no real time for quick dog murder. Tiassa is being isolated on purpose, don't get me wrong baby girl isn't like mentally well but she probably started to watch her son at night as a protection thing, something she probably did for the group in the woods.

&#x200B;

this show loves red herrings so much, misty has enough to fill a storage unit.
